{"unit_id":"a82e016731409a7aa74e","title":"提案四","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b1","raw_text":"提案四 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,47.216041564941406,92.0040054321289,63.17604064941406]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b2","raw_text":"案由：有關 Mirabegron (Betmiga) 與其他Anticholinergic 或 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":49,"bbox":[36.0,76.03604888916016,496.1200256347656,91.99604797363281]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b3","raw_text":"       Bethanechol 藥物併用之規範，提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[36.0,113.23600006103516,403.96002197265625,129.1959991455078]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b4","raw_text":"說明:  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":6,"bbox":[36.0,143.23599243164062,92.0040054321289,159.1959991455078]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b5","raw_text":"一. 全民健保給付規定：Tolterodine L-tartrate（如 Detrusitol）；\n","start_char":0,"end_char":50,"bbox":[50.15999984741211,171.57615661621094,550.6800537109375,189.37155151367188]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b6","raw_text":"solifenacin succinate（如 Vesicare）；mirabegron（如 Betmiga）： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":58,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,203.23599243164062,567.4199829101562,219.1959991455078]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b7","raw_text":"1. 限符合下列診斷標準條件之一者：(1)頻尿：每天（24 小時）排\n","start_char":0,"end_char":35,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,231.57615661621094,555.9600219726562,249.37155151367188]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b8","raw_text":"尿次數超過八次，並有 詳實病歷紀錄。(2)急尿：病患自述經常有\n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[99.86399841308594,263.2660217285156,559.2952880859375,279.22601318359375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b9","raw_text":"一種很突然、很強烈想解尿的感覺。(3)急迫 性尿失禁：對於尿急\n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[99.86399841308594,293.2660217285156,559.4070434570312,309.22601318359375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b10","raw_text":"的感覺無法控制，並於 24 小時內至少也有一次漏尿之情形。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[99.86399841308594,323.2660217285156,539.8200073242188,339.22601318359375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b11","raw_text":"2. 不宜使用本類藥品者：(1)小兒夜尿。(2)單純性應力性尿失禁。\n","start_char":0,"end_char":35,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,351.606201171875,555.9234008789062,369.4015808105469]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b12","raw_text":"(3)膀胱逼尿肌無反射 （detrusor areflexia）或膀胱不收縮所引\n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[99.86399841308594,383.2660217285156,559.2922973632812,399.22601318359375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b13","raw_text":"起之排尿困難或尿失禁之症狀。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":16,"bbox":[99.86399841308594,413.2660217285156,331.80999755859375,429.22601318359375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b14","raw_text":"3. Solifenacin succinate（如 Vesicare）及 mirabegron（如 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":52,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,441.6261901855469,540.1799926757812,459.42156982421875]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b15","raw_text":"Betmiga）藥品每天限使用 1 錠。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":22,"bbox":[99.86399841308594,473.2860107421875,347.8900146484375,489.2460021972656]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b16","raw_text":"二、 Anticholinergic 或 Bethanechol 治療，若單一藥物治療效果不佳 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":49,"bbox":[50.040000915527344,502.0860290527344,566.0999755859375,518.0460205078125]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b17","raw_text":"     時，是否可以併用 Betmiga ? \n","start_char":0,"end_char":25,"bbox":[50.040000915527344,538.0860595703125,306.1300048828125,554.0460205078125]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b18","raw_text":"建議：根據泌尿科審查注意事項 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":16,"bbox":[36.0,574.0860595703125,267.95001220703125,590.0460205078125]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b19","raw_text":"一、有關 Tolterodine; Solifenacin; Mirabegron(106/6/1) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":52,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,610.1160278320312,497.44000244140625,626.0759887695312]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b20","raw_text":"1. 病歷上應記載急尿或急迫性尿失禁或頻尿（每天24 小時排尿次數\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,646.1160278320312,558.5634155273438,662.0759887695312]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b21","raw_text":"超過八次），可直接病歷紀錄病人每日小便次數或排尿日誌或經認\n","start_char":0,"end_char":30,"bbox":[99.74400329589844,682.1160278320312,559.3200073242188,698.0759887695312]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p4-b22","raw_text":"證的問卷如OAB -SS。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[99.74400329589844,718.1160278320312,263.75,734.0759887695312]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b1","raw_text":"2. 每一種 antimuscarinics 都可以當作膀胱過動症之第一線治療藥\n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[78.38400268554688,46.016029357910156,558.2767944335938,61.97602844238281]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b2","raw_text":"物。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":4,"bbox":[99.6240005493164,82.03604888916016,139.63999938964844,97.99604797363281]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b3","raw_text":"3.當使用一段時間（如三個月）病人治療效果仍不佳時，在侵入性治\n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,118.03604888916016,558.3519897460938,133.9960479736328]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b4","raw_text":"療前，可以考慮增加劑量或增加第二種antimuscarinics 或合併 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[92.66400146484375,154.03604125976562,552.6599731445312,169.9960479736328]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b5","raw_text":"Mirabegron 使用。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":16,"bbox":[92.66400146484375,190.03604125976562,232.6699981689453,205.9960479736328]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b6","raw_text":"二、有關 Beta-3 agonist（106/6/1） \n","start_char":0,"end_char":30,"bbox":[50.15999984741211,226.03604125976562,330.25,241.9960479736328]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b7","raw_text":"1. 可以當作膀胱過動症之第一線治療用藥。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":23,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,262.0660095214844,391.45001220703125,278.0260009765625]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b8","raw_text":"2. Mirabegron 25mg 及50mg 均為合理之劑量。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":35,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,298.0660095214844,419.44000244140625,314.0260009765625]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b9","raw_text":"3. 當使用一段時間（如三個月）病人治療效果不佳時，可以考慮合併\n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,334.0660095214844,559.166015625,350.0260009765625]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b10","raw_text":"antimuscarinics 使用。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":21,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,370.0660095214844,265.5500183105469,386.0260009765625]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b11","raw_text":"決議：通過，同意說明暨建議段。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":17,"bbox":[36.0,407.2660217285156,283.9300231933594,423.22601318359375]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b12","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,437.2860107421875,43.97999954223633,453.2460021972656]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p5-b13","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,467.2860107421875,43.97999954223633,483.2460021972656]}],"source_quality":[]}